      "writtenOn": "2026-01-02T15:06:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the Skia build `SK_SUPPORT_LEGACY_UNSPANNED_GRADIENTS` is not defined by the build but is being set when including `SkGradientShader.h` (which was removed from this file with this change). However, other builds are setting `SK_SUPPORT_LEGACY_UNSPANNED_GRADIENTS` and so it is still defined even though the header isn\u0027t being included. That means these blocks exist in those builds and then fail because there is no declaration of `SkGradientShader`.\n\nIt looks like `SkGradientShader.h` still needs to be (conditionally) included, or these implementations be moved to somewhere where it is included, or users should be updated first and these implementations removed.",
      "parentUuid": "4a87f25f_0b8af328",
      "revId": "53426881ba4829e83ad48ee1874598cd9ea2e756",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
